('0637584a-791d-5e52-b6c5-4b1d372e0f47', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', null, 'Building an appropriate active-site motif into a hydrogen-evolution catalyst with thiomolybdate [Mo3S13]²⁻ clusters', 'Kibsgaard, Jaramillo & Besenbacher', 'Nat. Chem.', 2014, '10.1038/NCHEM.1853', 'rxn', 'Hydrogen (HER/HOR)', 'Builds the active motif directly into a cluster so that every unit is an edge-like site.', false, 30),
