('ac1744e9-2419-5b77-9608-6f7f1487f81e', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', null, 'Absence of CO2 electroreduction on copper, gold and silver electrodes without metal cations in solution', 'Monteiro, Koper et al.', 'Nat. Catal.', 2021, '10.1038/s41929-021-00655-5', 'intf', 'Cations, anions and fields', 'No cation, no CO2 reduction. It proposes direct, short-range cation coordination to *CO2⁻, which competes with the field-only picture.', true, 101),
