('16a889e2-05a1-5111-8b4f-07a7b284f2d4', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', null, 'Production of dimethylfuran for liquid fuels from biomass-derived carbohydrates', 'Román-Leshkov, Barrett, Liu & Dumesic', 'Nature', 2007, '10.1038/nature05923', 'front', 'Beyond the electrode: fuels and chemicals by thermal routes', 'A two-step route from fructose to a liquid fuel. A well-known example of designing a whole process around catalysis.', false, 193),
